---
title: "Splitting a battery fleet's revenue with dual prices"
description: "Two batteries sell more reserve capacity together than apart. The dual prices of the fleet's linear program split the sale so that no owner, and no group of owners, earns more by leaving."
date: 2026-11-08
image: "thumbnail.webp"
